# Project TITAN V1.3 — Work Journal & Assignee Policy (PM Approved)

**Lock:** 2026-07-06 · **Source:** `src/config/titanAssigneePolicy.js` · `src/utils/titanAssigneeResolver.js` · `src/utils/workJournalSession.js`

---

## Person-Centric Work Journal

- Each user sees **only their own entries by default**
- **Admin** (`isTitanAdminUser()`) may view all entries or filter by assignee
- Manual entries + append-only auto workflow events

## Default Assignee (All Registration Screens)

- Assignee defaults to **current logged-in user** mapped to workers Master dropdown value
- Resolver: `resolveDefaultAssigneeFromAuth()` in `titanAssigneeResolver.js`
- User may change via combobox/select from `getActiveWorkers()`

## Stored Fields

All registration data and journal entries store:

| Field | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `assignee` | Worker display name |
| `assigneeUserId` | Auth session userId |
| `workerCode` | Workers Master code |
| `department` | Worker department |

## Auto-Record Workflow Actions

On successful register/ship/issue, append to work journal via `appendWorkJournalAutoEntry()`:

| actionType | Screen |
|---|---|
| `inboundRegister` | 입고 |
| `productionDailyRegister` | 생산일보 |
| `inspectionRegister` | 검사 |
| `certificateIssue` | 성적서 |
| `outboundRegister` | 출고 |
| `inventoryAdjust` | 재고 (if applicable) |
| `qrRegister` | QR (future) |

## Module Field Names

See `ASSIGNEE_FIELD_BY_MODULE` in `titanAssigneePolicy.js`.

## UI Freeze

- **생산일보 UI Freeze** — assignee defaults + journal hooks only
- **입고 Popup** — no structural layout change

## Do Not

- Remove legacy `buildAutoJournalEntries` without migration path
- Hardcode assignee to `workers[0]`
- Show all users' journals to non-admin users
